{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"運輸署指今年首三季15名電單車司機死於交通意外\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-NUMBERS-261025-18.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】運輸署指今年首三季有15名電單車司機死於交通意外，較去年同期多。</p><p>署方在社交平台發文，提到首三季共有逾1500名電單車司機在交通意外中傷亡，指電單車車身相對較窄和保護較少，提醒司機必須戴頭盔。若無側車，就不可載超過一名乘客，駕駛時必須開頭燈和尾燈，亦不應盲目穿梭車群或駕駛期間用手機或戴耳機。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.804327+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T10:22:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.098737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:16.408081+00:00","content_hash":"8d7cc474fa6cab84d77f2eb01ca6594eff464c3d5bcb20f4aa148efdb0e5804e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.804327+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}